<odoo>
    <template id="report_invoice_ar_3tv_bms_container">
        <t t-call="web.html_container">
            <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="o">
                <t t-call="ins_base_api.report_invoice_ar_3tv_bms_document"/>
            </t>
        </t>
    </template>

    <template id="report_invoice_ar_3tv_bms_document">
        <t t-call="web.basic_layout">
                        <div class="page" style="font-size: 12px !important;">
                <t t-if="o.company_id.logo">
                    <img t-att-src="image_data_uri(o.company_id.logo)" class="float-left" style="max-height: 250px;max-width: 200px;  display: block;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto;" alt="Logo"/>
                </t>
                 <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-4"></div>
                    <div class="col-4" style="border-bottom: 1px dashed;"><center>I N V O I C E</center></div>
                    <div class="col-4"></div>
                 </div>
                 <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-4"></div>
                    <div class="col-4"><center><span t-esc="o.name"/></center></div>
                    <div class="col-4"></div>
                 </div>
                 <br/>
                 <br/>
                 <br/>
                 <br/>
                 <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-4">Bill To</div>
                            <div class="col-1">:</div>
                            <div class="col-7"><span t-esc="o.partner_id.name"/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-4">Date</div>
                            <div class="col-1">:</div>
                            <div class="col-7"><t t-esc="o.invoice_date.strftime('%d-%b-%Y')"/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                   
                 </div>

                 <div class="row">
                     <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-4">Address</div>
                            <div class="col-1">:</div>
                            <div class="col-7"><span t-field="o.partner_id"
                                    t-options='{"widget": "contact", "fields": ["address"], "no_marker": true}'/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-4">Register No</div>
                            <div class="col-1">:</div>
                            <div class="col-7"><span t-esc="o.po_numbers_gen21"/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                 </div>

                 <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-4">Advertiser</div>
                            <div class="col-1">:</div>
                            <div class="col-7"><t t-esc="o.advertiser_gen21"/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-4">Payment By</div>
                            <div class="col-1">:</div>
                            <div class="col-7"><t t-esc="o.pab_pbb_gen21"/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                 </div>
                 
                 <div class="row">
                     <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-4">TX/Channel</div>
                            <div class="col-1">:</div>
                            <div class="col-7"><t t-esc="o.channel_name_gen21"/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                 </div>
                 <br/>
                 <br/>
                 <div class="row mt-2" style="border-top: 1px dashed;border-bottom: 1px dashed;">
                    <div class="col-6"><center>Description</center></div>
                    <div class="col-6">Amount</div>
                 </div>
                 <br/>
                 <div class="row">
                    <t t-foreach="o.invoice_line_ids" t-as="line">
                        <div class="col-6">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-4">PENAYANGAN PRODUK</div>
                                <div class="col-1">:</div>
                                <div class="col-7"><t t-esc="o.ref"/></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-4">Periode</div>
                                <div class="col-1">:</div>
                                <div class="col-7"><t t-esc="o.period_id.name"/></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-6">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-5">Total Gross</div>
                                <div class="col-1">:</div>
                                <div class="col-6 text-right"><t t-esc="o.currency_id.symbol"/><t t-esc="'{:,.2f}'.format(line.total_gross_gen21)"/></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-5">Agency Disc <t t-esc="line.agency_discount_gen21"/>%</div>
                                <div class="col-1">:</div>
                                <div class="col-6 text-right" style="border-bottom: 1px dashed;"><t t-esc="o.currency_id.symbol"/><t t-esc="'{:,.2f}'.format(line.total_gross_gen21 * (line.agency_discount_gen21/100))"/></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-5">NET Amount</div>
                                <div class="col-1">:</div>
                                <div class="col-6 text-right"><t t-esc="o.currency_id.symbol"/> <t t-esc="'{:,.2f}'.format(o.amount_untaxed)"/></div>
                            </div>
                            <t t-set="taxes" t-value="o.get_tax_info()"/>
                            <t t-foreach="taxes" t-as="tax">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-5">
                                        <t t-esc="tax[0]"/>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-1">
                                        :
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-6 text-right">
                                        <t t-esc="o.currency_id.symbol"/><t t-esc="'{:,.2f}'.format(tax[1])"/>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </t>
                        </div>
                    </t>
                 </div>
                 <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-5">Due Date</div>
                            <div class="col-1">:</div>
                            <div class="col-6"><t t-esc="o.invoice_date_due.strftime('%d-%b-%Y')"/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-5">Total Amount Due</div>
                            <div class="col-1">:</div>
                            <div class="col-6 text-right"><t t-esc="o.currency_id.symbol"/><t t-esc="'{:,.2f}'.format(o.amount_total)"/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                 </div>
                 <br/>
                 <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-12" style="border-top: 1px dashed;">
                    </div>
                 </div>

                 <div class="row mt-2">
                    <div class="col-4">Terbilang</div>
                    <div class="col-1">:</div>
                    <div class="col-7">## <t t-esc="o.amount_due_in_words"/> ##</div>
                 </div>

                 <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-12" style="border-bottom: 1px dashed;">
                    </div>
                 </div>
                 <br/>
                 <br/>
                 <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-4">
                        Payment TO
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-8">
PT. MNC TELEVISI INDONESIA<br/>
Account at PT. MNC BANK INTERNASIONAL, TBK<br/>
Account No. 100.01.000009067.8<br/>
Account at PT. Bank Muamalat Indonesia Tbk<br/>
Account No. 301 020 1449 (IDR)
                    </div>
                 </div>
                 <br/>
                 <br/>
                 <br/>
                 <br/>
                 <br/>
                 <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-6">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-4">
                        <center>
                        Jakarta, <span t-esc="context_timestamp(datetime.datetime.now()).strftime('%d-%b-%Y')"/>
                        <br/>
                        <br/>
                        <br/>
                        <br/>
                        Veronika Lawy<br/>
                        <div style="border: 1px dashed;"/><br/>
                        (VP Accounting AND Billing 3TV)
                        </center>
                    </div>
                 </div>
                 <br/>
                 <br/>
                 <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-12">
                        <pre>
1. Mohon mencantumkan nama Perusahaan Anda dan Nomor Invoice saat transfer pembayaran.
2. Buku Pembayaran (bukti transfer) harap di-fax ke nomor (021)5300034.
3. Pembayaran melalui check atau giro dianggap telah lunas apabila dananya telah diterima.
4. Apabila terdapat kesalahan dalam invoice atau faktur pajak, mohon diberitahukan kepada keuangan PT.
   MNC Televisi Indonesia selambat-lambatnya 14 hari kerja setelah tangal dalam invoice ini, bukan
   tanggung jawab kami apabila permohonan perbaikan invoice atau faktur pajak tidak dapat kami penuhi
   apabila telah melewati masa 14 hari kerja setelah tanggal invoice
                        </pre>
                    </div>
                 </div>
            </div>
        </t>
    </template>
</odoo>